  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Work: No Child&apos;s Business - Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Key beneficiaries are children (boys and girls) aged 5 to 15 and youth aged 15 to 18 and their families.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Work: No Child&#xe2;&#x20ac;&#x2122;s Business&#xe2;&#x20ac;&#x2122; is a programme of an alliance consisting of the Stop Child Labour Coalition, UNICEF Netherlands and Save the Children that aims to make a strong and lasting contribution to the elimination of child labour in Mali.</narrative>
  </description>
